# Purpose

This document is the implementation guide for Sprint 1.

Unlike the previous blueprints, this is a working document.

Every completed task should result in one or more Git commits.

Progress should be measurable, visible and incremental.

**Rule:** Never move to the next section while the current one remains incomplete.

---

# Sprint Goal

Deliver the first complete Waypoint experience:

```text
Register
    ↓
Browse Trail
    ↓
Visit Business
    ↓
Scan QR Code
    ↓
Receive Passport Stamp
```

Everything in this build book contributes to that journey.

