# Sprint Exit Criteria

Sprint 1 is complete only when a brand-new developer can:

1. Clone the repository.
2. Follow the setup guide.
3. Run the project.
4. Register a new account.
5. Browse a trail.
6. Scan a QR code.
7. Receive a Passport Stamp.

Without manual intervention.

---

# Sprint Milestone

When the first Passport Stamp appears in the application:

**Stop.**

Take a screenshot.

Tag the commit.

Celebrate.

That moment represents the transition from architecture to product.

It is the first time that Project Waypoint has fulfilled the promise described in BP001.

